{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Univoyager is an ambitious indie Space Simulator created on a custom 3d engine where you can travel among the stars, explore planets and starports, trade and combat in a procedurally generated 1:1 universe with seamless planetary  and interstellar flight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/e52f1225d1686feae131f2718a633d62.poster.avif?t=1764609699\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/e52f1225d1686feae131f2718a633d62.webm?t=1764609699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/e52f1225d1686feae131f2718a633d62.mp4?t=1764609699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:  <br>-Seamless transition between Space/Planet and seamless Interplanetary and Interstellar travels<br>-Realistic Physics: Gravity, Collisions, Atmospheric Drag, Flying Dynamics  <br>-Planetary Orbits of the Solar System bodies calculated according to real Orbital Data  <br>-Database with more than 100,000 stars to explore  <br>-Planets and Stars in Real Size and Real Distance  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/db50edd57d85301b03d8f853397d8cf3.poster.avif?t=1764609699\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/db50edd57d85301b03d8f853397d8cf3.webm?t=1764609699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/db50edd57d85301b03d8f853397d8cf3.mp4?t=1764609699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Planet Maps are calculated starting from real data (where available) and take advantage of procedural algorithms to create close up details. <br>-Campaign and Freelance sandbox mode <br>-Full HOTAS support. Digital and analog commands are fully customizable. Tracking devices and VR support will be included in future releases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2834260?t=1764609699","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/9e069523674645f14ec1383d9badecaff4248f97/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764609699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/4076f27eb150c9dc9c35bf8f78127098706065be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764609699","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/4076f27eb150c9dc9c35bf8f78127098706065be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764609699","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Univoyager is an ambitious indie Space Simulator created on a custom 3d engine where you can travel among the stars, explore planets and starports, trade and combat in a procedurally generated 1:1 universe with seamless planetary  and interstellar flight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/e52f1225d1686feae131f2718a633d62.poster.avif?t=1764609699\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/e52f1225d1686feae131f2718a633d62.webm?t=1764609699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/e52f1225d1686feae131f2718a633d62.mp4?t=1764609699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:  <br>-Seamless transition between Space/Planet and seamless Interplanetary and Interstellar travels<br>-Realistic Physics: Gravity, Collisions, Atmospheric Drag, Flying Dynamics  <br>-Planetary Orbits of the Solar System bodies calculated according to real Orbital Data  <br>-Database with more than 100,000 stars to explore  <br>-Planets and Stars in Real Size and Real Distance  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/db50edd57d85301b03d8f853397d8cf3.poster.avif?t=1764609699\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/db50edd57d85301b03d8f853397d8cf3.webm?t=1764609699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834260/extras/db50edd57d85301b03d8f853397d8cf3.mp4?t=1764609699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Planet Maps are calculated starting from real data (where available) and take advantage of procedural algorithms to create close up details. <br>-Campaign and Freelance sandbox mode <br>-Full HOTAS support. Digital and analog commands are fully customizable. Tracking devices and VR support will be included in future releases.</p><p class=\"bb_parag